Pressed the Favorite menu bar icon (that's its name to Accessibility), which opens its menu or popover. A menu stays open until an item is picked: describe_ui {include_status_items: true} lists its items, screenshot {menus: true} shows it, press_menu_item {menu_bar: "status", path: ["Favorite", …]} picks one, and press_menu_item {close_menus: true} closes it. A popover is a window: list_windows, describe_ui, tap and screenshot work on it.
